# Northern Air Temple: "When Northern Air Temple enters, each opponent loses X life and you gain X life, where X is the number of
# Shrines you control." Bot1's Temple drains 1 (Shrines Bot1 controls: itself); it does not trigger its own "another Shrine you
# control enters" (19, 21). Bot2's own Temple then enters: Bot2 counts only its own Shrine, so X is 1, not 2 (Bot1 20, Bot2 20),
# and Bot1's Temple does not trigger for a Shrine Bot2 controls.

